{
  "esm": "1.0.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "WSM6ColdAccretion",
    "description": "Collection (accretion) process rates between the six water species of the WRF single-moment 6-class microphysics scheme below and above freezing (WSM6; Hong and Lim 2006 appendix A; Lin et al. 1983; Rutledge and Hobbs 1983, 1984), transcribed from the cold-rain block of mp_wsm6_run in phys/physics_mmm/mp_wsm6.F90 (WRF 4.8, NCAR/MMM-physics): accretion of cloud ice by rain (praci), of rain by cloud ice (piacr), of cloud ice by snow (psaci) and by graupel (pgaci) -- all only below 0 C --, of cloud water by snow (psacw) and by graupel (pgacw) and their snow/graupel-weighted combination (paacw), of snow by rain (pracs, below 0 C), of rain by snow (psacr) and by graupel (pgacr), the eliminated snow-by-graupel term (pgacs = 0 since WRF V3.0, when snow and graupel received a common fall speed), and the enhanced melting of snow and graupel above 0 C by the sensible heat of the liquid water they collect (pseml, pgeml). Each collection rate is the geometric sweep-out of one species by another: pi/4 n0 |V_a - V_b| times a size-distribution kernel (collection_kernel_* templates) times the collected mixing ratio, with the collection efficiencies (eacrs = exp(-0.07 (T0 - T)) for ice, 1 for water) and WSM6's empirical reduction min(max(0, q_collector/q_collected), 1)^2 folded into the UNLIMITED rate because they are functions of the state alone. The kernel additionally applies per-process time-step limiters (a sink may not remove more than q/dtcld per sub-step; pseml/pgeml are also floored at zero), exposed separately as <rate>_lim with the sub-step length dtcld as a parameter -- time-step artefacts, not physics (FORTRAN_BUGS.md note N3); the mass-conservation rescaling applied afterwards is not part of this component. The size distributions, number concentrations and fall speeds are supplied by hydrometeor_slopes.esm mounted as subsystem `sd` (referenced as sd.<name>), exactly as the kernel evaluates them once per sub-step and reuses them here; cloud water qc and the sub-step dtcld are this component's own inputs. Scheme constants come from wsm6_parameters.esm (subsystem `par`), physical constants from lib/wrf_constants.esm (`wrf`). Consumer-supplied inputs are the rewrite-target ops `input_<name>` lowered in the inline tests through a per-test template library generated by tools/fill_tests.py from the instrumented WRF dumps (esm-spec 6.6 parameter_overrides admit scalars only).",
    "license": "MIT",
    "tags": ["wrf", "microphysics", "wsm6", "accretion", "ice-phase", "column"],
    "references": [
      { "citation": "Hong, S.-Y., and J.-O. J. Lim (2006). The WRF single-moment 6-class microphysics scheme (WSM6). J. Korean Meteor. Soc. 42, 129-151. Appendix A eqs. A6, A7, A10-A13, A15, A17, A19, A24, A34." },
      { "citation": "Hong, S.-Y., J. Dudhia, and S.-H. Chen (2004). A revised approach to ice microphysical processes for the bulk parameterization of clouds and precipitation. Mon. Wea. Rev. 132, 103-120 (eq. 10, psaci).", "doi": "10.1175/1520-0493(2004)132<0103:ARATIM>2.0.CO;2" },
      { "citation": "Lin, Y.-L., R. D. Farley, and H. D. Orville (1983). Bulk parameterization of the snow field in a cloud model. J. Climate Appl. Meteor. 22, 1065-1092 (eqs. 24-29, 40-42)." },
      { "citation": "Rutledge, S. A., and P. V. Hobbs (1984). The mesoscale and microscale structure and organization of clouds and precipitation in midlatitude cyclones. XII. J. Atmos. Sci. 41, 2949-2972 (eqs. A21-A22, enhanced melting)." },
      { "citation": "NCAR/MMM-physics mp_wsm6.F90 at commit 550b5b4 (WRF 4.8 phys/physics_mmm submodule), cold-rain block lines 968-1140." }
    ]
  },
  "models": {
    "WSM6ColdAccretion": {
      "expression_template_imports": [ { "ref": "./microphysics_templates.esm" } ],
      "subsystems": {
        "wrf": { "ref": "../../../lib/wrf_constants.esm" },
        "par": { "ref": "./wsm6_parameters.esm" },
        "sd": { "ref": "./hydrometeor_slopes.esm" }
      },
      "variables": {
        "qc": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Cloud-water mixing ratio." },
        "dtcld": { "type": "parameter", "units": "s", "default": 60.0, "description": "Length of the WSM6 sub-time step; enters only the rate limiters." },
        "pacrc": { "type": "unknown", "units": "1/(m^(341/100)*s)", "description": "Snow-cloud accretion coefficient pi n0s avts Gamma(3 + bvts) E_sc/4 (WSM6 pacrc); units for bvts = 0.41." },
        "pacrg": { "type": "unknown", "units": "1/(m^(19/5)*s)", "description": "Graupel-cloud accretion coefficient pi n0g avtg Gamma(3 + bvtg)/4 (WSM6 pacrg); units for bvtg = 0.8." },
        "supcol": { "type": "unknown", "units": "K", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Supercooling T0 - T (positive below freezing; WSM6 supcol)." },
        "eacrs": { "type": "unknown", "units": "1", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Collection efficiency of cloud ice by snow and graupel, exp(-0.07 (T0 - T)) (WSM6 eacrs = egi)." },
        "K_ri": { "type": "unknown", "units": "m^3", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Collection kernel of ice crystals by rain, 2 lambda_r^-3 + 2 D_i lambda_r^-2 + D_i^2 lambda_r^-1." },
        "K_si": { "type": "unknown", "units": "m^3", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Collection kernel of ice crystals by snow." },
        "K_gi": { "type": "unknown", "units": "m^3", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Collection kernel of ice crystals by graupel." },
        "K_sr": { "type": "unknown", "units": "m^7", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Collection kernel of snow (collected) by rain (collector)." },
        "K_rs": { "type": "unknown", "units": "m^7", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Collection kernel of rain (collected) by snow (collector)." },
        "K_rg": { "type": "unknown", "units": "m^7", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Collection kernel of rain (collected) by graupel (collector)." },
        "E_ri": { "type": "unknown", "units": "1", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Efficiency reduction min(max(0, qr/qi), 1)^2 of praci." },
        "E_ir": { "type": "unknown", "units": "1", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Efficiency reduction min(max(0, qi/qr), 1)^2 of piacr." },
        "E_sc": { "type": "unknown", "units": "1", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Efficiency reduction min(max(0, qs/qc), 1)^2 of psacw." },
        "E_gc": { "type": "unknown", "units": "1", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Efficiency reduction min(max(0, qg/qc), 1)^2 of pgacw." },
        "E_rs": { "type": "unknown", "units": "1", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Efficiency reduction min(max(0, qr/qs), 1)^2 of pracs." },
        "E_sr": { "type": "unknown", "units": "1", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Efficiency reduction min(max(0, qs/qr), 1)^2 of psacr." },
        "E_gr": { "type": "unknown", "units": "1", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Efficiency reduction min(max(0, qg/qr), 1)^2 of pgacr." },
        "praci": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Accretion of cloud ice by rain below 0 C (I->R; HL A15, LFO 25), unlimited." },
        "praci_lim": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "praci after the limiter min(praci, qi/dtcld) (WSM6 praci as applied)." },
        "piacr": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Accretion of rain by cloud ice below 0 C (R->S or R->G; HL A19, LFO 26), pi^2 a_r n0r rho_w N_i (rho0/rho)^(1/2) Gamma(6 + b_r) lambda_r^-(6+b_r)/(24 rho) times the efficiency reduction, unlimited." },
        "piacr_lim": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "piacr after the limiter min(piacr, qr/dtcld)." },
        "psaci": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Accretion of cloud ice by snow below 0 C (I->S; HDC 10), pi/4 qi E_si n0s(T) |V_sg - V_i| K_si, unlimited." },
        "psaci_lim": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "psaci after the limiter min(psaci, qi/dtcld)." },
        "pgaci": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Accretion of cloud ice by graupel below 0 C (I->G; HL A17, LFO 41), unlimited." },
        "pgaci_lim": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "pgaci after the limiter min(pgaci, qi/dtcld)." },
        "psacw": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Accretion of cloud water by snow (C->S below 0 C, C->R above; HL A7, LFO 24), pacrc n0s(T)/n0s lambda_s^-(3+b_s) qc (rho0/rho)^(1/2) times the efficiency reduction, unlimited." },
        "psacw_lim": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "psacw after the limiter min(psacw, qc/dtcld)." },
        "pgacw": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Accretion of cloud water by graupel (C->G below 0 C, C->R above; HL A6, LFO 40), unlimited." },
        "pgacw_lim": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "pgacw after the limiter min(pgacw, qc/dtcld)." },
        "paacw": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Accretion of cloud water by the combined snow/graupel category, the mixing-ratio-weighted mean of the limited psacw and pgacw (WSM6 paacw; this is the term the kernel actually applies to cloud water)." },
        "pracs": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Accretion of snow by rain below 0 C (S->G; HL A11, LFO 27), pi^2 n0r n0s(T) |V_r - V_sg| (rho_s/rho) K_sr times the efficiency reduction, unlimited." },
        "pracs_lim": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "pracs after the limiter min(pracs, qs/dtcld)." },
        "psacr": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Accretion of rain by snow (R->S or R->G below 0 C; enhances snow melting above; HL A10, LFO 28), pi^2 n0r n0s(T) |V_sg - V_r| (rho_w/rho) K_rs times the efficiency reduction, unlimited." },
        "psacr_lim": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "psacr after the limiter min(psacr, qr/dtcld)." },
        "pgacr": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Accretion of rain by graupel (R->G below 0 C; enhances graupel melting above; HL A12, LFO 42), unlimited." },
        "pgacr_lim": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "pgacr after the limiter min(pgacr, qr/dtcld)." },
        "pgacs": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Accretion of snow by graupel (HL A13, LFO 29): identically zero since WRF V3.0, when snow and graupel were given the common fall speed V_sg (WSM6 sets pgacs = 0)." },
        "pseml": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Enhanced melting of snow above 0 C by the sensible heat of the accreted liquid water, c_l (T0 - T)(paacw + psacr_lim)/L_f (negative; HL A34, RH84 A21), unlimited." },
        "pseml_lim": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "pseml after the limiter min(max(pseml, -qs/dtcld), 0)." },
        "pgeml": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Enhanced melting of graupel above 0 C by the accreted liquid water, c_l (T0 - T)(paacw + pgacr_lim)/L_f (negative; HL A24, RH84 A22), unlimited." },
        "pgeml_lim": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "pgeml after the limiter min(max(pgeml, -qg/dtcld), 0)." }
      },
      "equations": [
        { "lhs": "qc", "rhs": { "op": "input_qc", "args": [] } },
        { "lhs": "pacrc", "rhs": { "op": "/", "args": [{ "op": "*", "args": ["wrf.piconst", "par.n0s", "par.avts", "par.g3pbs", "par.eacrc"] }, 4] } },
        { "lhs": "pacrg", "rhs": { "op": "/", "args": [{ "op": "*", "args": ["wrf.piconst", "par.n0g", "par.avtg", "par.g3pbr"] }, 4] } },
        { "lhs": "supcol", "rhs": { "op": "-", "args": ["wrf.svpt0", "sd.T"] } },
        { "lhs": "eacrs", "rhs": { "op": "exp", "args": [{ "op": "-", "args": [{ "op": "*", "args": ["par.eacrs_coef", "supcol"] }] }] } },
        { "lhs": "K_ri", "rhs": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "collection_kernel_ice_by_precipitation", "bindings": { "D": "sd.D_i", "rslope": "sd.rslope_r", "rslope2": "sd.rslope2_r", "rslope3": "sd.rslope3_r" } } },
        { "lhs": "K_si", "rhs": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "collection_kernel_ice_by_precipitation", "bindings": { "D": "sd.D_i", "rslope": "sd.rslope_s", "rslope2": "sd.rslope2_s", "rslope3": "sd.rslope3_s" } } },
        { "lhs": "K_gi", "rhs": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "collection_kernel_ice_by_precipitation", "bindings": { "D": "sd.D_i", "rslope": "sd.rslope_g", "rslope2": "sd.rslope2_g", "rslope3": "sd.rslope3_g" } } },
        { "lhs": "K_sr", "rhs": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "collection_kernel_precipitation_by_precipitation", "bindings": { "rslope_a": "sd.rslope_s", "rslope2_a": "sd.rslope2_s", "rslope3_a": "sd.rslope3_s", "rslope_b": "sd.rslope_r", "rslope2_b": "sd.rslope2_r", "rslope3_b": "sd.rslope3_r" } } },
        { "lhs": "K_rs", "rhs": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "collection_kernel_precipitation_by_precipitation", "bindings": { "rslope_a": "sd.rslope_r", "rslope2_a": "sd.rslope2_r", "rslope3_a": "sd.rslope3_r", "rslope_b": "sd.rslope_s", "rslope2_b": "sd.rslope2_s", "rslope3_b": "sd.rslope3_s" } } },
        { "lhs": "K_rg", "rhs": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "collection_kernel_precipitation_by_precipitation", "bindings": { "rslope_a": "sd.rslope_r", "rslope2_a": "sd.rslope2_r", "rslope3_a": "sd.rslope3_r", "rslope_b": "sd.rslope_g", "rslope2_b": "sd.rslope2_g", "rslope3_b": "sd.rslope3_g" } } },
        { "lhs": "E_ri", "rhs": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "collection_efficiency_reduction", "bindings": { "q_collector": "sd.qr", "q_collected": "sd.qi", "q_min": "par.qmin", "expn": "par.wilt_exp" } } },
        { "lhs": "E_ir", "rhs": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "collection_efficiency_reduction", "bindings": { "q_collector": "sd.qi", "q_collected": "sd.qr", "q_min": "par.qmin", "expn": "par.wilt_exp" } } },
        { "lhs": "E_sc", "rhs": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "collection_efficiency_reduction", "bindings": { "q_collector": "sd.qs", "q_collected": "qc", "q_min": "par.qmin", "expn": "par.wilt_exp" } } },
        { "lhs": "E_gc", "rhs": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "collection_efficiency_reduction", "bindings": { "q_collector": "sd.qg", "q_collected": "qc", "q_min": "par.qmin", "expn": "par.wilt_exp" } } },
        { "lhs": "E_rs", "rhs": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "collection_efficiency_reduction", "bindings": { "q_collector": "sd.qr", "q_collected": "sd.qs", "q_min": "par.qmin", "expn": "par.wilt_exp" } } },
        { "lhs": "E_sr", "rhs": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "collection_efficiency_reduction", "bindings": { "q_collector": "sd.qs", "q_collected": "sd.qr", "q_min": "par.qmin", "expn": "par.wilt_exp" } } },
        { "lhs": "E_gr", "rhs": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "collection_efficiency_reduction", "bindings": { "q_collector": "sd.qg", "q_collected": "sd.qr", "q_min": "par.qmin", "expn": "par.wilt_exp" } } },
        { "lhs": "praci", "rhs": { "op": "ifelse", "args": [
            { "op": "and", "args": [{ "op": ">", "args": ["supcol", 0] }, { "op": ">", "args": ["sd.qi", "par.qmin"] }, { "op": ">", "args": ["sd.qr", "par.qcrmin"] }] },
            { "op": "*", "args": [{ "op": "/", "args": ["wrf.piconst", 4] }, "sd.qi", "par.n0r", { "op": "abs", "args": [{ "op": "-", "args": ["sd.vt_r", "sd.vt_i"] }] }, "K_ri", "E_ri"] },
            0 ] } },
        { "lhs": "praci_lim", "rhs": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "sink_rate_limiter", "bindings": { "rate": "praci", "q": "sd.qi", "dt": "dtcld" } } },
        { "lhs": "piacr", "rhs": { "op": "ifelse", "args": [
            { "op": "and", "args": [{ "op": ">", "args": ["supcol", 0] }, { "op": ">", "args": ["sd.qi", "par.qmin"] }, { "op": ">", "args": ["sd.qr", "par.qcrmin"] }] },
            { "op": "*", "args": [{ "op": "/", "args": [{ "op": "*", "args": [{ "op": "^", "args": ["wrf.piconst", 2] }, "par.avtr", "par.n0r", "wrf.rhowater", "sd.xni", "sd.denfac", "par.g6pbr", "sd.rslope3_r", "sd.rslope3_r", "sd.rslopeb_r"] }, { "op": "*", "args": [24, "sd.rho"] }] }, "E_ir"] },
            0 ] } },
        { "lhs": "piacr_lim", "rhs": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "sink_rate_limiter", "bindings": { "rate": "piacr", "q": "sd.qr", "dt": "dtcld" } } },
        { "lhs": "psaci", "rhs": { "op": "ifelse", "args": [
            { "op": "and", "args": [{ "op": ">", "args": ["supcol", 0] }, { "op": ">", "args": ["sd.qi", "par.qmin"] }, { "op": ">", "args": ["sd.qs", "par.qcrmin"] }] },
            { "op": "*", "args": [{ "op": "/", "args": ["wrf.piconst", 4] }, "sd.qi", "eacrs", "par.n0s", "sd.n0sfac", { "op": "abs", "args": [{ "op": "-", "args": ["sd.vt_sg", "sd.vt_i"] }] }, "K_si"] },
            0 ] } },
        { "lhs": "psaci_lim", "rhs": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "sink_rate_limiter", "bindings": { "rate": "psaci", "q": "sd.qi", "dt": "dtcld" } } },
        { "lhs": "pgaci", "rhs": { "op": "ifelse", "args": [
            { "op": "and", "args": [{ "op": ">", "args": ["supcol", 0] }, { "op": ">", "args": ["sd.qi", "par.qmin"] }, { "op": ">", "args": ["sd.qg", "par.qcrmin"] }] },
            { "op": "*", "args": [{ "op": "/", "args": ["wrf.piconst", 4] }, "eacrs", "sd.qi", "par.n0g", { "op": "abs", "args": [{ "op": "-", "args": ["sd.vt_sg", "sd.vt_i"] }] }, "K_gi"] },
            0 ] } },
        { "lhs": "pgaci_lim", "rhs": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "sink_rate_limiter", "bindings": { "rate": "pgaci", "q": "sd.qi", "dt": "dtcld" } } },
        { "lhs": "psacw", "rhs": { "op": "ifelse", "args": [
            { "op": "and", "args": [{ "op": ">", "args": ["sd.qs", "par.qcrmin"] }, { "op": ">", "args": ["qc", "par.qmin"] }] },
            { "op": "*", "args": ["pacrc", "sd.n0sfac", "sd.rslope3_s", "sd.rslopeb_s", "E_sc", "qc", "sd.denfac"] },
            0 ] } },
        { "lhs": "psacw_lim", "rhs": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "sink_rate_limiter", "bindings": { "rate": "psacw", "q": "qc", "dt": "dtcld" } } },
        { "lhs": "pgacw", "rhs": { "op": "ifelse", "args": [
            { "op": "and", "args": [{ "op": ">", "args": ["sd.qg", "par.qcrmin"] }, { "op": ">", "args": ["qc", "par.qmin"] }] },
            { "op": "*", "args": ["pacrg", "sd.rslope3_g", "sd.rslopeb_g", "E_gc", "qc", "sd.denfac"] },
            0 ] } },
        { "lhs": "pgacw_lim", "rhs": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "sink_rate_limiter", "bindings": { "rate": "pgacw", "q": "qc", "dt": "dtcld" } } },
        { "lhs": "paacw", "rhs": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "snow_graupel_weighted_mean", "bindings": { "x_s": "psacw_lim", "q_s": "sd.qs", "x_g": "pgacw_lim", "q_g": "sd.qg", "q_floor": "par.qmin" } } },
        { "lhs": "pracs", "rhs": { "op": "ifelse", "args": [
            { "op": "and", "args": [{ "op": ">", "args": ["sd.qs", "par.qcrmin"] }, { "op": ">", "args": ["sd.qr", "par.qcrmin"] }, { "op": ">", "args": ["supcol", 0] }] },
            { "op": "*", "args": [{ "op": "^", "args": ["wrf.piconst", 2] }, "par.n0r", "par.n0s", "sd.n0sfac", { "op": "abs", "args": [{ "op": "-", "args": ["sd.vt_r", "sd.vt_sg"] }] }, { "op": "/", "args": ["par.dens", "sd.rho"] }, "K_sr", "E_rs"] },
            0 ] } },
        { "lhs": "pracs_lim", "rhs": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "sink_rate_limiter", "bindings": { "rate": "pracs", "q": "sd.qs", "dt": "dtcld" } } },
        { "lhs": "psacr", "rhs": { "op": "ifelse", "args": [
            { "op": "and", "args": [{ "op": ">", "args": ["sd.qs", "par.qcrmin"] }, { "op": ">", "args": ["sd.qr", "par.qcrmin"] }] },
            { "op": "*", "args": [{ "op": "^", "args": ["wrf.piconst", 2] }, "par.n0r", "par.n0s", "sd.n0sfac", { "op": "abs", "args": [{ "op": "-", "args": ["sd.vt_sg", "sd.vt_r"] }] }, { "op": "/", "args": ["wrf.rhowater", "sd.rho"] }, "K_rs", "E_sr"] },
            0 ] } },
        { "lhs": "psacr_lim", "rhs": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "sink_rate_limiter", "bindings": { "rate": "psacr", "q": "sd.qr", "dt": "dtcld" } } },
        { "lhs": "pgacr", "rhs": { "op": "ifelse", "args": [
            { "op": "and", "args": [{ "op": ">", "args": ["sd.qg", "par.qcrmin"] }, { "op": ">", "args": ["sd.qr", "par.qcrmin"] }] },
            { "op": "*", "args": [{ "op": "^", "args": ["wrf.piconst", 2] }, "par.n0r", "par.n0g", { "op": "abs", "args": [{ "op": "-", "args": ["sd.vt_sg", "sd.vt_r"] }] }, { "op": "/", "args": ["wrf.rhowater", "sd.rho"] }, "K_rg", "E_gr"] },
            0 ] } },
        { "lhs": "pgacr_lim", "rhs": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "sink_rate_limiter", "bindings": { "rate": "pgacr", "q": "sd.qr", "dt": "dtcld" } } },
        { "lhs": "pgacs", "rhs": { "op": "*", "args": [0, "sd.qs"] } },
        { "lhs": "pseml", "rhs": { "op": "ifelse", "args": [
            { "op": "and", "args": [{ "op": "<=", "args": ["supcol", 0] }, { "op": ">", "args": ["sd.qs", 0] }] },
            { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "enhanced_melting_by_accretion", "bindings": { "T": "sd.T", "t0": "wrf.svpt0", "accreted": { "op": "+", "args": ["paacw", "psacr_lim"] }, "cliq": "wrf.cliq", "xlf": "wrf.xlf" } },
            0 ] } },
        { "lhs": "pseml_lim", "rhs": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "negative_sink_limiter", "bindings": { "rate": "pseml", "q": "sd.qs", "dt": "dtcld" } } },
        { "lhs": "pgeml", "rhs": { "op": "ifelse", "args": [
            { "op": "and", "args": [{ "op": "<=", "args": ["supcol", 0] }, { "op": ">", "args": ["sd.qg", 0] }] },
            { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "enhanced_melting_by_accretion", "bindings": { "T": "sd.T", "t0": "wrf.svpt0", "accreted": { "op": "+", "args": ["paacw", "pgacr_lim"] }, "cliq": "wrf.cliq", "xlf": "wrf.xlf" } },
            0 ] } },
        { "lhs": "pgeml_lim", "rhs": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "negative_sink_limiter", "bindings": { "rate": "pgeml", "q": "sd.qg", "dt": "dtcld" } } }
      ],
      "tests": [
        {
          "id": "qss_step250_row23_col24_mixed_phase_accretion",
          "description": "Reference: WRF 4.8 em_quarter_ss idealized supercell (GNU real32 build, dx = 2 km, dt = 12 s, 40 layers, WSM6 only) dumped by the instrumented ctessum-claude/WRF fork (module_esm_dump with esm_dump_inner hooks inside mp_wsm6_run of the ctessum-claude/MMM-physics fork, commit 52cfbd7) and replayed through the real64 (kind_phys = real64) standalone kernels/wsm6_driver at the WRF step. POINTWISE and step-free: the inputs are the state at which the kernel evaluates its process rates (t_rates, qc/qi/qr/qs/qg_rates after the sub-step's sedimentation, melting, freezing and slope update; den), the expected values the rates the kernel dumps right after evaluating them (`<rate>_raw`: after each process's own time-step limiter, before the mass-conservation rescaling) and the mp_wsm6_init coefficients, from the real64 replay. No small-dt replay because WSM6's increments are not rate x dt (FORTRAN_BUGS.md N3). The size distributions, N_i, D_i and fall speeds come from hydrometeor_slopes.esm mounted as subsystem sd on the same inputs (its own tests pin them to the dump). Real64 replay vs real32 dump: <= 1e-5 relative in these rates. Residual esm-vs-real64 mismatch, from the kernel's default-real literals and real32 WRF constants (pi, avtr, bvtr, bvts, n0s, dens, 0.07, 1.49e4, 1.31, 5.38e7, 11.9, ...; FORTRAN_BUGS.md N2), measured with zero tolerances: <= 1.7e-7 of each column's maximum (psaci; praci 8e-9, piacr 6e-8, pgaci 3e-8, psacw 9e-8, pracs 2e-8, psacr 1.4e-8, pgacr 5e-9, pgeml 6e-8). Tolerances are set 5-10x above: relative 1e-6 on the coefficients, absolute Linf_error bounds on the limited whole columns at 1e-6 of each column's maximum, and relative 2e-6 spot checks of the UNLIMITED rates at layers where the kernel's limiter is provably inactive (the dumped rate is below half of q/dtcld there; in this column only pracs at layer 11 and pgacr at layer 13 are limited). Regime: supercell step 250 (t = 50 min), row j = 23, column i = 24: freezing level at layer 9; rain 1-16, cloud water 1-20, snow 6-33, graupel 1-33, ice 9-39; every accretion process is active (praci/piacr/pracs/psacr in 9-16, psaci/pgaci in 9-32, psacw 9-20, pgacw/pgacr from layer 8, where T is just above 0 C so pgeml is active at 1.5e-18 kg/kg/s and pseml is zero because there is no snow). Exception: pseml and pgeml are proportional to the supercooling T0 - T, which is -0.15 K in the only active layer, so the kernel's real32 T0 = 273.1499939 K (6e-6 K off) shows up as a 4e-6 relative difference; their tolerances are therefore rel 5e-5 and Linf 1e-4 of the column maximum.",
          "parameter_overrides": {
            "dtcld": 12.0
          },
          "expression_template_imports": [
            {
              "ref": "./tests/qss_step250_row23_col24_mixed_phase_accretion_inputs.esm"
            }
          ],
          "time_span": {
            "start": 0.0,
            "end": 1.0
          },
